MEANING
- head_tokens count one token per (chain, key head) work item. Tokens of an operation = head_tokens / n_key_heads.
- busy_cycles = entry stamp (right after the GatedDeltaNet TRACE_EVENT) to exit stamp of one call that had work. start + recurrence + write <= busy.
- GDN wall of one operation of one forward = last worker exit minus first worker entry, raw TSC across cores. totals.wall_cycles is the sum over operations, so it compares with forwards.wall_cycles.
- A worker with an empty shard returns before the hooks and counts no job.
- All cycle values are TSC cycles; tsc_hz is in the summary.
